---
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-black border-b border-neutral-900" id="about">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Founder Persona & Direct Contact Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#C6FF3D] uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
            03 // The Person Behind OTHR
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">
            Direct collaboration. No middlemen.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <p class="font-body text-base text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          The biggest risk in hiring an agency is paying senior rates only to have your project handed to inexperienced junior subcontractors. At OTHR, you collaborate directly with the engineer writing your code.
        </p>

        <!-- Founder Card -->
        <div class="p-6 bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-900 rounded-2xl space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center font-display font-black text-xl text-[#C6FF3D]">
              SS
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-white">Shiva Sajay</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-neutral-400">Founder & Lead Engineer</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-[#C6FF3D] font-mono mt-0.5">Kochi, India • Working Everywhere</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-neutral-900 space-y-2.5 text-xs">
            <a
              href="tel:+919995228904"
              class="flex items-center justify-between text-neutral-300 hover:text-[#C6FF3D] transition-colors py-1 group"
            >
              <span class="font-mono text-neutral-500">Direct Phone:</span>
              <span class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                +91 99952 28904
                <Icon name="ArrowUpRight" size={13} />
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="mailto:shivasajay23@gmail.com"
              class="flex items-center justify-between text-neutral-300 hover:text-[#C6FF3D] transition-colors py-1 group"
            >
              <span class="font-mono text-neutral-500">Direct Email:</span>
              <span class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                shivasajay23@gmail.com
                <Icon name="ArrowUpRight" size={13} />
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="https://x.com/othrbuilds"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="flex items-center justify-between text-neutral-300 hover:text-[#C6FF3D] transition-colors py-1 group"
            >
              <span class="font-mono text-neutral-500">Updates on X:</span>
              <span class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                @othrbuilds
                <Icon name="ArrowUpRight" size={13} />
              </span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Authentic Founder Note & Standards -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8">
        
        <!-- Note Body -->
        <div class="space-y-5 font-body text-base text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            I started OTHR with a straightforward thesis: <strong class="text-white">great software does not require an army of account managers or months of bureaucratic meetings</strong>. It requires an engineer who genuinely understands your business constraints, communicates clearly, and delivers what was promised.
          </p>

          <p>
            Having built internal systems for automotive dealerships (automating end-of-month payroll pipelines for 2,500+ employees under strict Meta WhatsApp API burst limits) as well as interactive 3D browser tools, I know that real engineering begins where tutorials end.
          </p>

          <p>
            When we work together:
          </p>

          <!-- 3 Concrete Pillars -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-900 rounded-xl">
              <div class="text-[#C6FF3D] font-mono font-bold text-xs mb-1">01 / Clarity</div>
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-white mb-1">Zero Jargon</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">Plain English explanations of what we are building, why, and how it works.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-900 rounded-xl">
              <div class="text-[#C6FF3D] font-mono font-bold text-xs mb-1">02 / Predictability</div>
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-white mb-1">Fixed Scopes</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">Defined deliverables, rapid sprint timelines (1–4 weeks), and zero invoice surprises.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-900 rounded-xl">
              <div class="text-[#C6FF3D] font-mono font-bold text-xs mb-1">03 / Reliability</div>
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-white mb-1">Real Accountability</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">I test, deploy, and verify everything myself. If something breaks, I fix it.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
            <a
              href="#contact"
              class="px-6 py-3.5 bg-[#C6FF3D] hover:bg-[#d4ff66] text-black font-bold text-sm rounded-lg transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-2"
            >
              <span>Work directly with Shiva</span>
              <Icon name="ArrowUpRight" size={15} />
            </a>
            <a
              href="/studio"
              class="px-5 py-3.5 bg-neutral-900 hover:bg-neutral-800 text-neutral-300 hover:text-white font-medium text-sm rounded-lg transition-colors"
            >
              Read studio origin
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
